## 💡 **Reasoning**

### Why Remove "Loại Laptop"?
- ❌ Too granular (gaming, văn phòng, đồ họa)
- ❌ Hard to maintain categories
- ✅ Users can filter on product page
- ✅ Simpler navigation

### Why Remove "Kích Thước" (Tablet)?
- ❌ Not a common filter
- ❌ Most users don't care about exact size
- ✅ Can show on product details
- ✅ Reduces clutter

### Why Keep Only 2 in "Phụ Kiện"?
- ✅ **Tai nghe:** Popular category
- ✅ **Pin dự phòng:** Essential accessory
- ❌ Other items less common
- ❌ Too many options confuse users

### Why Remove "Đặc biệt"?
- ❌ Duplicate of homepage features
- ❌ "Sản phẩm mới" changes frequently
- ❌ "Khuyến mãi" has dedicated page
- ✅ Keep menu focused on core categories

